WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.243
- [sighs]

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.844
HAPPY SUNDAY, ESTHER.

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:14.680
- HAPPY SUNDAY, GEORGINA.

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:15.848
HOW WAS YOUR WEEK?

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:18.418
- OH, THE LORD IS WITH ME.
- MM-HMM.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.752
- BUT THE DEVIL,

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:22.588
HE GOT HIS HANDS
ON MY GRANDNIECE GRACE.

00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:24.190
- OH, NO.
- MM-HMM.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:27.860
OUT THERE SMOKING THE REEFER,
DOING THE HANKY-PANKY WITH BOYS.

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:29.028
- NO, GEORGINA.

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:30.963
- OH, ESTHER, YOU KNOW

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:34.567
THAT I LOVE ALL THINGS
THAT ARE GOOD AND HOLY.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.537
- MM-HMM.
- BUT IF HE DOESN'T LET GO

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.740
OF MY GRANDNIECE GRACE,

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.076
I'M GONNA CUT
THE DEVIL'S [bleep] OFF

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.410
AND SHOVE IT IN HIS ASS.

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:46.679
- MM-HMM.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:49.849
- WITH MY PRAYERS.
- I KNOW YOU WILL, GEORGINA.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:52.318
I KNOW YOU WILL.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:53.519
- HOW WAS YOUR WEEK, GIRL?

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.088
- OH, YOU KNOW ME.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.824
I'M BLESSED AND THANKFUL
FOR EVERYTHING.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.392
- MM-HMM.
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:03.129
- BUT YOU KNOW MY GRANDSON JASON
GOT HISSELF WRAPPED UP

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:05.798
IN THE LEATHERY CLAWS OF SATAN.

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:08.434
- NOT JASON.
- HE GOT HISSELF ARRESTED

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.470
FOR THE SPRAY-PAINTING
AND THE VANDALISM.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.804
- OH, LORD.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:14.507
- AND I TELL YOU, I NEVER

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.110
RAISE MY HAND IN ANGER,

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:20.146
BUT IF HE DON'T LET JASON GO,

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:24.250
I'M GONNA PUNCH THAT [bleep]
SATAN IN THE NUTS SO HARD,

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:28.187
IT WIPE THE [bleep]-LICKING
SMIRK OFF HIS HORNED-ASS FACE.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.555
- MM-HMM.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:31.090
- WITH MY PRAYERS.
- AMEN.

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:33.459
I KNOW YOU WILL, ESTHER,
I KNOW YOU WILL,

00:01:33.492 --> 00:01:35.995
BUT ESTHER, I GOTTA TELL YOU
SOMETHING ELSE, NOW.

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:37.196
- MMM, LET IT OUT.

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:38.498
- YOU KNOW, ESTHER,

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.934
THAT I HAVE FOUND SERENITY
IN THE GLORY OF HEAVEN.

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:43.436
- YES.

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:47.406
- BUT MY DAUGHTER'S HUSBAND
BERNARD HAS GOT HIMSELF WEDGED

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:50.376
BETWEEN THE CLEFT HOOVES
OF LUCIFER HISSELF.

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:51.644
- MMM.
- SHE OPENED UP

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.746
HIS LAPTOP COMPUTER

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:55.081
AND FOUND
THE PORNOGRAPHY OF WOMEN.

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.182
- NOT THE PORNOGRAPHY OF WOMEN.

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.084
- ABSOLUTELY
THE PORNOGRAPHY OF WOMEN.

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.485
- NOT ON THE LAPTOP COMPUTER.

00:01:59.518 --> 00:02:01.554
- ON THE LAPTOP COMPUTER FOUND
THE PORNOGRAPHY OF WOMEN.

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:02.722
- MMM.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.358
- I AM A PACIFIST
UNDER GOD'S REQUEST,

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.960
BUT IF HE DON'T LET GO
OF BERNARD,

00:02:07.993 --> 00:02:11.864
I'M GONNA SNEAK UP
ON THAT BITCH-ASS LUCIFER

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:14.133
RIGHT IN THE MIDST
OF HIS SLEEP TIME.

00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:15.301
- OH.
- AND THEN I'M GONNA SIT

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.170
ON THAT MOTHER[bleep]'S HEAD,

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.673
AND I'M GONNA SPREAD MY BOOTY
CHEEKS ON THAT PIG'S FACE,

00:02:20.706 --> 00:02:22.909
AND I'M GONNA JUST
PUCKER UP MY STANK HOLE...

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:23.910
- WHOO.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.711
- AND JUST TOOPS, TOOPS, TOOPS,

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:27.847
SCOOPS,
BEDOOP-SCOOP-SCOOP-SKEDOOPS

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.550
UNTIL THAT [bleep]
GOT A BROWN DOT ON HIS NOSE

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.351
THAT I CAN USE
FOR TARGET PRACTICE.

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:33.586
SHA-PLOW!

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:34.654
- SHOOT THAT.
- SHA-PLOW!

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:36.022 line:91%
- SHOOT THAT!
- SHA-PLOW!

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:38.891
- WHOO, SHOOT THAT [bleep]
IN THE [bleep]-NACK.

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:40.059
- WITH MY PRAYERS.

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:42.094
- WITH YOUR PRAYERS,
OF COURSE, OF COURSE.

00:02:42.127 --> 00:02:44.597
OH, GEORGINA, GEORGINA,
GEORGINA.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.898
- YUP, YUP, YUP, YUP, YUP?

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:49.602
- OH, I GOT NOTHING BUT FAITH
IN GOD AND HEAVEN ABOVE,

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:52.171
BUT I TELL YOU,
MY SON'S WIFE CRYSTAL,

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:55.541
SHE GOT HERSELF WRAPPED UP
IN THE FIERY WINGS

00:02:55.574 --> 00:02:56.742
OF MEPHISTOPHELES HISSELF.

00:02:56.775 --> 00:02:58.144
- HERE WE GO.

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:02.448
- YOU KNOW, SHE GOT CAUGHT USING
PROFANITY WITH HER OWN CHILDREN.

00:03:02.481 --> 00:03:04.183
- WHAT?
- AT THE DINNER TABLE.

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:06.719
- OH, LORD, CHILD, CHILD.

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:09.722
- GEORGINA DARLENE MARTIN!

00:03:09.755 --> 00:03:15.428
OH, I HAVE NOTHING BUT LOVE FOR
EVERY CREATURE ON THIS PLANET,

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:18.931
BUT IF HE DON'T LET
MY DARLING CRYSTAL GO,

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:21.634
I'M GONNA FLIRT WITH THE DEVIL.
- OH. OH.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.202
- SHOW HIM A LITTLE BIT
OF SHOULDER.

00:03:23.235 --> 00:03:24.637
"HOW YOU DOIN'?"

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.872
HE GONNA START LOOKING AWAY,
I'M GONNA START TWERKING.

00:03:26.905 --> 00:03:28.541
START TWERKING,
HE GONNA BE LIKE, "WHOO."

00:03:28.574 --> 00:03:29.675
HE GONNA BE,
HE GONNA BE DRAWN IN.

00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:30.710
- MM-HMM.

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.378
- SEDUCE THAT LITTLE
MOTHER[bleep].

00:03:32.411 --> 00:03:34.113
GIVE HIM ONE OF THESE.
"HI."

00:03:34.146 --> 00:03:35.848
BATTING MY EYELASHES AT HIM.

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:37.483
THEN WHEN HE LEAST EXPECTS IT,

00:03:37.516 --> 00:03:41.287
AND I GOT HIS TRUST, THAT'S WHEN
I'M GONNA RIDE THAT [bleep].

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.489
I'M GONNA GIVE HIM
THE NIGHT OF HIS LIFE,

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:45.291
A NIGHT
HE AIN'T NEVER GONNA FORGET.

00:03:45.324 --> 00:03:46.792
- GO GET HIM.
- I'M GONNA GIVE HIM THIS WAY.

00:03:46.825 --> 00:03:48.194
I'M GONNA GIVE HIM THAT WAY.

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:50.830
AND THEN,
RIGHT WHEN HE ABOUT TO CLIMAX,

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:53.532
THAT'S WHEN I'M GONNA CLENCH
UP MY [bleep]

00:03:53.565 --> 00:03:56.135
ON THAT MOTHER[bleep]'S
RED [bleep],

00:03:56.168 --> 00:04:01.073
AND I'M GONNA SNAP THAT [bleep]
[bleep] OFF WITH A DIVINE KEGEL.

00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:03.643
- WELL, YOU GONNA SNAP THAT
[bleep] [bleep] OFF.

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:05.678
- WHOO!
- SNAP IT OFF! WHOO!

00:04:05.711 --> 00:04:07.013
- WITH MY PRAYERS.
- WITH YOUR PRAYERS.

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:08.014
WITH YOUR PRAYERS.
- WITH MY PRAYERS.

00:04:08.047 --> 00:04:09.215
- OF COURSE.
WITH THE PRAYERS, YEAH.

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:10.483
BUT THAT'S RIGHT, GIRL.
- YES.

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:11.884
- YOU GO GET HIM, ESTHER!
- YES!

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:13.319
- [bleep] SATAN!
- [bleep] HIM!

00:04:13.352 --> 00:04:16.356
- [bleep] HIM IN THE--

00:04:20.626 --> 00:04:24.330
- WHA--WHAT'S HAPPENING,
GEORGINA?

00:04:24.363 --> 00:04:26.198
- [deep voice]
GEORGINA ISN'T HERE ANYMORE.

00:04:26.231 --> 00:04:28.968
[maniacal laugh]

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:31.737
IT IS I, SATAN.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:32.738
- AH!

00:04:32.771 --> 00:04:35.741
[blows landing]

00:04:35.774 --> 00:04:37.076
- [normal voice]
AH! NO, ESTHER!

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:38.477
I'M IN HERE, THOUGH!
- OH!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.812
- I'M KICKING
THIS [bleep]'S ASS.

00:04:39.845 --> 00:04:41.714
- YEAH!
[blows landing]

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:43.749
- [deep voice] OH, HELP ME.
SOMEBODY HELP ME.

00:04:43.782 --> 00:04:45.017
I CA--CAN'T GET OUT
OF THIS BITCH.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.386
- OH, GET HIM, GEORGINA!
GET HIM!

00:04:47.419 --> 00:04:48.754
- [normal voice]
I STUCK A SAFETY PIN

00:04:48.787 --> 00:04:50.189
IN THIS [bleep]'S URETHRA.

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:51.490
- OOH!
- [deep voice] OWW!

00:04:51.523 --> 00:04:54.060
[bleep]!
THAT HURTS!

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.094
[normal voice]
RIGHT NOW I GOT HIS [bleep]

00:04:55.127 --> 00:04:56.429
IN MY HANDS LIKE A OLD RAG.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:59.965
I'M WRINGING OUT!
I'M WRINGING IT OUT!

00:04:59.998 --> 00:05:01.667
- OH, GIVE ME SOME OF THAT.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.469
I WANT A PIECE OF HIM, YES.

00:05:03.502 --> 00:05:06.639
TAG ME IN.

00:05:06.672 --> 00:05:09.408
[groans]

00:05:09.441 --> 00:05:12.011
[gasps]

00:05:12.044 --> 00:05:13.546
[deep voice]
WHO IS THIS CRAZY BITCH, NOW?

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.314
[normal voice]
AH, IT'S ME, MOTHER[bleep]!

00:05:15.347 --> 00:05:18.217
YOUR WORST NIGHTMARE, BITCH!
[laughs]

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.552
THAT'S RIGHT, [bleep].
I'M ON TOP OF YOU.

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:20.720
I'M ON TOP OF HIM.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:21.954
[deep voice]
WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:05:21.987 --> 00:05:24.190
THIS FEELS GOOD.
WHY WOULD YOU DO THIS TO ME?

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:25.424
[normal voice]
OH, YOU'LL SEE IN A SECOND,

00:05:25.457 --> 00:05:27.259
MOTHER[bleep].
- JUST WAIT, MOTHER[bleep].

00:05:27.292 --> 00:05:28.627
- [deep voice] OH, I'M WAITING,
BUT OH, HERE I [bleep].

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.628
HERE I [bleep].

00:05:29.661 --> 00:05:30.629
[normal voice]
HERE YOU GO, HA!

00:05:30.662 --> 00:05:32.965
GRABBED IT!
SNAP!

00:05:32.998 --> 00:05:35.401
- OOH!
- OOH, I GOT HIM GOOD.

00:05:35.434 --> 00:05:36.469
[deep voice]
I'LL DO ANYTHING YOU SAY.

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:37.470
I'LL DO ANYTHING YOU SAY.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:39.405
- TOO LATE NOW.
TOO LATE NOW, SATAN.

00:05:39.438 --> 00:05:41.240
OH, SHH.
WE SHOULD PROBABLY GO.

00:05:41.273 --> 00:05:42.441
- [normal voice]
OH, YEAH, LET'S GO, LET'S GO.

00:05:42.474 --> 00:05:43.642
- WE DON'T WANT TO
DISTURB THE SERVICE.

00:05:43.675 --> 00:05:44.877
- OOH, I GOT A HOLD OF HIM.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.046
I'M GONNA--WE GONNA GO
MEDIEVAL ON HIS ASS.

00:05:47.079 --> 00:05:49.682
[deep voice] NO, NO!
OH, LORDY! I CAN'T TAKE IT.

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:50.750
I CAN'T TAKE IT.

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:52.184
[normal voice]
GET OVER HERE, MISTER.

00:05:52.217 --> 00:05:53.386
[deep voice]
PLEASE, PLEASE!

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:57.156
GET THESE CRAZY BITCHES
OFF OF ME.

00:05:57.189 --> 00:05:59.392
JESUS CHRIST IS MY PERSONAL LORD
AND SAVIOR, I SWEAR.

00:05:59.425 --> 00:06:01.227
- YOU'RE TOO LATE FOR THAT NOW.

